<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SHARE A LITTLE JOY</view><view class="title section">{{editingId?'更新这份快乐':'好玩的滑梯，值得被找到。'}}</view><view class="subtitle">留下准确的位置，让下一位探索者少走弯路。</view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">01　标记位置 *</text><button class="location" bindtap="choose"><text class="pin">◎</text><view class="grow"><view>{{form.latitude!==null?'已选择位置 · 点击重新选择':'在地图上选择滑梯位置'}}</view><view class="muted">{{form.address||'请尽量标记到滑梯所在位置，而非公园大门'}}</view></view><text>›</text></button></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">02　给它一个名字 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="例如：河畔公园的小象滑梯" maxlength="40" value="{{form.title}}" data-field="title" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">详细地址 *</text><input class="input" placeholder="补充入口、楼层或附近标志物" maxlength="160" value="{{form.address}}" data-field="address" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">03　大家想知道的</text><view class="row"><picker class="grow" range="{{types}}" data-field="type" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.type}} ▾</view></picker><picker class="grow" range="{{ages}}" data-field="ageBand" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.ageBand}} ▾</view></picker></view></view>
<view class="row"><picker class="cost-picker" range="{{costs}}" data-field="cost" bindchange="select"><view class="select">{{form.cost}} ▾</view></picker><input class="input grow" placeholder="开放时间（选填）" maxlength="80" value="{{form.openingHours}}" data-field="openingHours" bindinput="input" /></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">配套设施（选填）</text><view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{amenities}}" wx:key="label" class="chip {{item.selected?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item.label}}" bindtap="amenity">{{item.label}}</button></view></view>
<view class="field"><text class="label">04　分享你的发现 *</text><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="滑梯是什么样的？适合多大的孩子？有什么到访小贴士？（至少5个字）" maxlength="1000" value="{{form.description}}" data-field="description" bindinput="input"/><view class="count muted">{{form.description.length}} / 1000</view></view>
<view class="notice">分享内容和昵称将公开展示。请分享真实到访体验，避免填写个人联系方式。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view>
<button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">{{editingId?'保存更新':'＋ 把快乐标在地图上'}}</button><button wx:if="{{editingId}}" class="ghost section" bindtap="cancelEdit">取消编辑，开始新的分享</button><view class="draft-note muted">未发布的内容会自动保存为本机草稿</view></view><privacy-dialog id="privacy"/>
